---
import SimplePage from '../../components/content/SimplePage.astro';
import { PRACTICE } from '@vmd/config';
---

<SimplePage
  title="Complaints & Feedback"
  description="How to raise a concern about our service, how we handle it, and the external bodies you can contact — including the OMARA and the OAIC."
  eyebrow="Checkable"
  lead="We publish this because accountability should be easy to find."
  cta={{ href: '/contact/', label: 'Contact the practice' }}
>
  <p>
    We take concerns seriously and treat every complaint as a chance to put something right and
    improve how we work. You can raise a concern at any time, and doing so will never affect how we
    handle your matter.
  </p>

  <h2>How to raise a complaint</h2>
  <p>
    Please contact us first so we have the chance to resolve it directly. You can reach us by email
    at <a href={`mailto:${PRACTICE.contact.email}`}>{PRACTICE.contact.email}</a>, by phone on{' '}
    <a href={`tel:${PRACTICE.contact.phone}`}>{PRACTICE.contact.phoneDisplay}</a>, or through our{
      ' '
    }
    <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>. It helps if you tell us what happened, when, and the
    outcome you are looking for.
  </p>

  <h2>How we handle it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>We acknowledge your complaint in writing</strong> within 5 business days of receiving it,
      so you know it has reached the right person.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>We review it properly.</strong> Your complaint is considered by the Registered Migration
      Agent, who will look into what happened and may contact you for further detail.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>We respond with an outcome</strong> — normally within 30 days. If a complaint is complex
      and needs longer, we will tell you why and keep you updated on our progress.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>We keep it confidential</strong> and handle any personal information in accordance with
      our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>If you are not satisfied</h2>
  <p>
    If we cannot resolve your complaint to your satisfaction, you can escalate it at any time — you
    do not have to come to us first, and lodging a complaint will not affect a current visa
    application:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Concerns about the conduct of a registered migration agent —{' '}
      <a href={PRACTICE.regulator.complaintsUrl} rel="noopener" target="_blank"
        >make a complaint to the OMARA</a
      >, the Office of the Migration Agents Registration Authority.
    </li>
    <li>
      Concerns about how we have handled your personal information —{' '}
      <a href="https://www.oaic.gov.au/privacy/privacy-complaints" rel="noopener" target="_blank"
        >the Office of the Australian Information Commissioner (OAIC)</a
      >, on 1300 363 992.
    </li>
  </ul>
</SimplePage>

<style>
  h2 {
    font-size: var(--type-h3);
    margin-block: var(--space-6) var(--space-2);
    color: var(--color-action);
  }
  ul {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-4);
    padding-inline-start: var(--space-5);
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  li {
    padding-inline-start: var(--space-1);
  }
</style>
